ive works",[96,172,173],{},[99,174,175],{},"You MUST:",[109,177,178,181,184,187,190],{},[112,179,180],{},"Keep your project open source under AGPL-3.0",[112,182,183],{},"Provide access to your source code",[112,185,186],{},"Include the AGPL-3.0 license",[112,188,189],{},"Preserve copyright notices",[112,191,192],{},"Document any changes you make",[145,194,196],{"id":195},"commercial-projects","Commercial Projects",[96,198,199],{},"When using Custom Fields under a Commercial License:",[96,201,202],{},[99,203,156],{},[109,205,206,209,212,215,218],{},[112,207,208],{},"Use Custom Fields in closed-source applications",[112,210,211],{},"Modify the code without publishing changes",[112,213,214],{},"Distribute your application without source code",[112,216,217],{},"Keep your proprietary code private",[112,219,220],{},"Use in unlimited client projects (agencies)",[96,222,223],{},[99,224,225],{},"You CANNOT:",[109,227,228,231,234,237,240],{},[112,229,230],{},"Redistribute the Custom Fields source code itself",[112,232,233],{},"Resell Custom Fields as a standalone product",[112,235,236],{},"Remove copyright or license notices",[112,238,239],{},"Share your commercial license with others",[112,241,242],{},"Exceed your license tier's revenue/team limits",[91,244,71],{"id":245},"contributing",[96,247,248],{},"We welcome contributions from the community!",[104,250,252],{"id":251},"how-to-contribute","How to Contribute",[254,255,256,262,268,274],"ol",{},[112,257,258,261],{},[99,259,260],{},"Fork the repository"," on GitHub",[112,263,264,267],{},[99,265,266],{},"Create a feature branch"," for your changes",[112,269,270,273],{},[99,271,272],{},"Submit a pull request"," with a clear description",[112,275,276,279],{},[99,277,278],{},"Sign the CLA"," (Contributor License Agreement) if required",[104,281,283],{"id":282},"contribution-guidelines","Contribution Guidelines",[109,285,286,289,292,295],{},[112,287,288],{},"Follow the existing code style and conventions",[112,290,291],{},"Write 